    {
        "id": "ja:word:fixtures-fridge",
        "label": "れいぞうこ",
        "class": "lexical:noun",
        "fields": {
            "pronunciation": ["れいぞうこ"],
            "usage_notes": {
                "en": "Common short form of refrigerator. Fridges adds /ɪz/. 冷蔵庫 is れいぞうこ; preserve the long sounds in れい and ぞう.",
                "de": "Übliche Kurzform von refrigerator. Fridges erhält /ɪz/. 冷蔵庫 lautet れいぞうこ; れい und ぞう werden lang gesprochen.",
                "id": "Bentuk pendek umum dari refrigerator. Fridges menambah /ɪz/. 冷蔵庫 dibaca れいぞうこ; pertahankan bunyi panjang れい dan ぞう.",
                "ja": "Refrigerator の一般的な短縮形。Fridges は /ɪz/ を加える。冷蔵庫はれいぞうこで、れい・ぞうの長い音を保つ。"
            },
